### Phase 2: Ecosystem Securitization & Stabilization

Successfully stabilized the AI economy by addressing critical security vulnerabilities and operational instability.

- **Security Redaction**: Identified and redacted exposed Solana private keys from [.env](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/.env) files. Added explicit rotation warnings.
- **Financial Safety Guards**: Implemented [SafetyGuard.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/SafetyGuard.ts), a centralized validation layer that enforces daily spend limits ($1000 USDC), transaction caps ($100 USDC), and stop-loss thresholds (15%) for all autonomous swarm activities.
- **Unified Launch & Orchestration**: Created [ecosystem.config.cjs](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/ecosystem.config.cjs) using PM2 to manage all background services (Telemetry, Executor, UI). This prevents "zombie" processes and port locks.
- **Graceful Shutdown**: Added Signal handlers (`SIGINT`, `SIGTERM`) to core scripts to ensure clean exits and resource release.

